            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Kehai’s first public release.

- Browse current Mac windows and Safari tabs in one visual, searchable view.
- Generate task-based groups with OpenAI and retain them across launches.
- Navigate by keyboard, preview selected windows live, and return directly to interrupted work.
- Hide individual windows or permanently exclude apps from capture and AI grouping.
]]></description>
